<<!DOCTYPE type=`memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki` spec=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/memetic-wikitext`>>

<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.intent.asks`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "ask for approval of an intent, with a detail"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.intent.asks", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.intent.asks"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.intent.asks"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.intent.asks ~ ask ~ needs approval

`lares intent ask <intent-id>` signs an ask naming the intent (by id, or a claim's cid) as needing approval; `--detail` carries the words the answerer reads.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ ask

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`ask` params=`target/<intent-id> detail/[[ship at dawn]] ~ ask approval with a detail`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ target · detail · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`target` params=`takes/id needs/required seat/1 as/<target> ~ the intent's id, or a claim's cid`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`detail` params=`takes/words ~ what the answerer reads beside the ask`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose intent plane this reads or writes, a whole persona index from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand key/face-atom ~ signs under the face's own atom key through the store door`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · face-malformed · face-not-held · intent-id-absent

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ an unknown sub-verb, or no sub-verb named`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-malformed` params=`~ --face names a whole persona index from 0`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-not-held` params=`~ this vessel holds no such face`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`intent-id-absent` params=`~ name the intent`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ cid

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`cid` params=`exit/0 ~ the signed entry's cid prints`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares intent ask

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares intent ask]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

